%% W2D5 - Reflection & Self-Correction Loops - Request Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Application
    participant Gate as Confidence Gate
    participant Gen as Generate Node
    participant Crit as Critique Node
    participant Rev as Revise Node
    participant Store as State Store
    participant Log as Audit Logger

    User->>App: Submit task request
    App->>Gate: Score request complexity
    alt High-confidence request - skip reflection
        Gate-->>App: Confidence above threshold
        App->>Gen: Generate single-pass output
        Gen-->>App: Draft output
        App-->>User: Return validated output
    else Low-confidence request - enter reflection loop
        Gate-->>App: Confidence below threshold
        App->>Gen: Generate initial draft
        Gen-->>Store: Save draft v1 + iteration=1
        Store-->>App: State updated
        App->>Crit: Evaluate draft v1 against rubric
        Crit-->>App: Criterion results (pass/fail per item)
        Note over App,Crit: Each criterion evaluated independently
        alt All criteria pass on first evaluation
            App->>Log: Log pass at iteration 1
            App-->>User: Return validated output
        else Criteria fail - iteration 1 under cap
            App->>Rev: Revise failing sections only
            Note over Rev: Revision prompt scoped to failing criteria only
            Rev-->>Store: Save draft v2 + iteration=2
            App->>Crit: Re-evaluate draft v2 against rubric
            Crit-->>App: Updated criterion results
            alt All criteria pass on second evaluation
                App->>Log: Log pass at iteration 2
                App-->>User: Return validated output
            else Max iterations reached
                App->>Log: Log partial pass + failing criteria list
                App-->>User: Return best draft with partial_pass flag
            end
        end
    end
    App->>Log: Append full iteration history to audit log
